          <q1:parameter uniqueID="UID_SUB_401101" access="readWrite">
            <description lang="en">0 encoder only; 1 encoder, observer blended in above olo (oblend); 2 sensorless: HFI and the observer, no encoder in the loop (position mode refused, the encoder is only logged); 3 Hall sensors, observer above olo (oblend); 4 Hall + HFI: HFI at low speed, the Halls from hyblo to hybhi up, observer above olo. 3 and 4 need no encoder; position comes from them. Needs the calibrations for that source (sensorless: R, L, t, kv, saliency map, polarity; Hall: Hall table, t; Hall + HFI: also R, L, saliency map)</description>
            <USINT />
            <q1:defaultValue value="0" />
            <q1:allowedValues>
